```
# Rust/Cargo specific ignores
target/
Cargo.lock
**/*.rs.bk
**/*.tmp

# Dependencies
vendor/

# Logs and temp files
*.log
*.tmp

# Environment
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Coverage reports
coverage/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# Build artifacts from other tools
dist/
build/
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.a
*.o
*.obj
*.out
```